\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Service and stability table. Latency, backlog, and state size are measured under a fixed arrival and resource budget. The paired last column is old-root drop fraction / recovery steps; UNKNOWN rates and owner-truth recall remain in the ledger. PeerSelect false attribution is N/A without an owner-truth contract. Mutation rows test whether recipient-owned, mixed, delayed, or out-of-order events produce safe no-op or \textsc  {unknown}{} behavior rather than false producer credit.}}{3}{table.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
